  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/17ee53f0aa3cebaac16ad79ae2fa79e562336dde52fe9a4fd41bdb0c7ce4a2a3.png] \n\nLet's check each option by interchanging ÷ and ×,\n\n1) 9 × 3 + 8 ÷ 4 - 7 = 30\n\n→ **9 ÷ 3** + 8 × 4 - 7 = 30\n\n→ 3 + **8 ****×**** 4** - 7 = 30\n\n→ **3 + 32** - 7 = 30\n\n→ **__35 - 7__** = 30\n\n→ 28 ≠ 30\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) 11 ÷ 12 × 6 + 8 - 10 = 25\n\n→ 11 × **12 ÷ 6** + 8 - 10 = 25\n\n→ **11 × 2** + 8 - 10 = 25\n\n→ **22 + 8** - 10 = 25\n\n→ __**30 - 10**__ = 25\n\n→ 20 ≠ 25\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n3) **23 - 20 + 35 ÷ 2 × 10 = 10**\n\n→ 23 - 20 + 35 × **2 ÷ 10** = 10\n\n→ 23 - 20 + **35 ****× 1/5** = 10\n\n→ **23** - 20 **+ 7** = 10\n\n→ **__30 - 20__** = 10\n\n**→ 10 = 10**\n\n→ **LHS = RHS ⇒ Satisfies the equation.**\n\n4) 32 + 3 - 12 ÷ 18 × 9 = 10\n\n→ 32 + 3 - 12 × **18 ÷ 9** = 10\n\n→ 32 + 3 - **12 ****× 2** = 10\n\n→ **32 + 3** - 24 = 10\n\n→ **__35 - 24__** = 10\n\n→ 11 ≠ 10\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****Option 3\"**.",
